  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Respectfully, I don't see a benefit to this most recent change.\n\nIn fact, if you're scrolling past 20 different instances with randomized names and similar player counts, you'll end up losing your place in the list quite easily. This is especially relevant if you are looking through group publics, in particular, where you're trying to see which group is running a particular instance.\n\nAllowing non-random names for everyone would solve the above issue. [Related Canny](https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1706-instance-naming-shouldnt-be-vrc-locked) about not locking lobby names to VRC+, as naming lobbies has been a very standard non-paywalled thing on other platforms for decades (remember Gamespy?).",
